      "statement": "auto_triage._ruleset_decide() is a heuristic (non-LLM) decider that proposes: relabel to done for a plan whose linkcheck progress is 'implemented', discard for a needs_decision-flagged document older than 180 days, and promote for a watching document whose due has arrived (or, for a legacy watching document with no due at all, older than 14 days as a fallback); each suggestion carries a confidence score and reason, and only a separate --apply step executes any of them via the same apply_action() used elsewhere.",
